Package: motusclean
Type: Package
Title: Prepare and Validate Motus Detections
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Adam", "Smith", email = "asmith@abcbirds.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prepares Motus wildlife tracking detections for automated quality
    assessment and manual run-level validation. Produces review materials,
    vetted detection maps, and versioned hit-level exports.
